title: lore_3_6_9_stone
---
[Lore Stone: 3-6-9 PROPHECY FRAGMENT]
"Three by six by nine.
The triangle, the hexagram, the nonagon.
These are the three frequencies of stone.
If you sing them in this order — three, six, nine —
the buried wakes."
===

title: lore_dome_inscription
---
[Inscription carved at the Listeners' Hall threshold]
"WE BUILT FOR THE EAR.
WE BUILT FOR THE PULSE BENEATH.
THE WALLS ARE NOT WALLS. THEY ARE INSTRUMENTS.
SING TO THEM, AND THEY WILL SING BACK."
===

title: lore_fountain_inscription
---
[Inscription on the fountain basin]
"THIS WATER REMEMBERS.
EVERY SONG SUNG ABOVE IT IS WRITTEN
INTO THE PATTERNS OF ITS RIPPLES.
TO READ THE PAST, DRINK AND LISTEN."
===

title: lore_spire_inscription
---
[Inscription at the base of the spire]
"FIRST NOTE.
ALL HARMONIES BEGIN HERE.
WHEN YOU HEAR THE PURE TONE OF THIS PILLAR,
YOU WILL KNOW THE BASELINE OF THE WORLD."
===

title: lore_carved_stone_fragment
---
[Carved stone fragment — larger structure implied]
"...AND ON THE THIRTEENTH MOON
THE THREE BANDS WILL CONVERGE
AND THE WORLD WILL WAKE."
===

title: lore_root_chamber_inscription
---
[Wall mosaic in the root chamber]
"BENEATH EVERY DOME, A ROOT.
BENEATH EVERY ROOT, A SONG.
THE EARTH HUMS AT SEVEN-EIGHT-THREE HERTZ.
WE LEARNED TO HUM WITH HER."
===

title: lore_overlook_inscription
---
[Etched on the overlook platform]
"FROM HERE THE VALLEY READS LIKE A SCORE.
EACH BUILDING IS A NOTE.
THE WIND IS THE BAR LINE.
LISTEN. THE SONG GOES ON."
===
